":2554654792,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6YRPBI","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Overall this is extremely good! We have discussed a few fine points already and have agreed that:\r\n1. Doing the prepass is fine. Its unfortunate, but its a necessary complexity we agree to live with\r\n2. The shader code will need to have a spec constant or a separate variant (I think we need a variant anyway, so this is likely a non problem (because we need the multiview definition. So we can just check `#if defined(MULTIVIEW) && defined(MOTION_VECTORS)`)\r\n\r\nThe last thing before merging is doing performance testing on low end desktop devices and non-XR mobile devices. In the rendering meeting Bastiaan raised a concern (that I share) that this could have a negative impact on all scenes (not just when using MVs). So we should do careful testing before merging. \r\n\r\nAt this point though I suspect this is nearly ready to merge (once my new comment is addressed) and could be merged right after 4.4 is released.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":